                    <h1 class="c-article-title" data-test="article-title" data-article-title="">CO<sub>2</sub>, CH<sub>4,</sub> and N<sub>2</sub>O Emissions in Two Major Subtropical Hydroelectric Reservoirs in South America Are Linked to Anthropogenic Eutrophication</h1>

                    <ul class="c-article-identifiers">
                        
        <li class="c-article-identifiers__item" data-test="article-category">Original Article</li>
    
    

                        <li class="c-article-identifiers__item">
                            Published: <time datetime="2025-08-19">19 August 2025</time>
                        </li>
